,{"spoiler":false,"text":"She likes help people and and make them happy, but despite this kindness, she is stubborn whenever doing a favor."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her body possesses a strong sexual-appeal, with a thing waist, big breast, and a huge ass."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Due to this, she often get lustful stares from men, and has a hard time being sexually open."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She and the Protagonist used to live close to each other, and she often babysat him, being a surrogate big-sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When the protagonist was transferred to the new school, her was reunited with her after a long time."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, due to the protagonist amorous gaze, she is filled with fear and discomfort."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She felt guilty about feeling this way and kept quiet about the, but after being raped by him, she realizes her intuition was correct."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"On the other hand, although she resents the protagonist for raping her, she is still cares for him, which leaves her at his mercy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Whenever they're at school, she calls the protagonist by his last name, but in private, she calls him by his first name, befitting a childhood friend."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c89342"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"音楽教科を担当する女性教師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真面目で面倒見がよく、快活な性格で親しみやすいため学生達から慕われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人を助け喜んでもらうのが好きで、そんな優しさを持つ一方、強く頼み事をされると毅然と断れないという面も持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"細い腰に大きな胸と尻という非常にセックスアピールの強い身体つきをしており、男性からの好色な視線を向けられることが多く、そのせいで性に関わることを苦手に思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは過去に住む家が近かったため、当時は幼なじみの姉貴分としてよく面倒を見ていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在、転校してきた主人公と久しぶりの再開を果たすもしかし、久しぶりに再会した主人公が向けてきた欲望に燃える肉食獣のような目に違和感と恐怖を覚える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな感情を抱いてしまうことに罪悪感を持ち、表には出さないようにしていたものの、現実に主人公に犯されることとなり、自身の直感が正しかったことを痛感する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一方で、自分を犯した主人公に対する怒りや恨みはあれど、情を捨てきることもできず、翻弄されてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"公私はし